      seoDescription: 'Run Riyadh, Jeddah, and Eastern Province stores on one stock and finance picture — transfers, weekend peaks, and ZATCA-ready invoicing at POS.',
      seoDescriptionAr: 'شغّل متاجر الرياض وجدة والشرقية على stock و finance واحد — transfers و weekend peaks و invoicing ZATCA-ready عند POS.',
