      seoDescription: 'Prepare Saudi SME systems for ZATCA phases — master data, device onboarding, invoice fields, and sandbox testing before production issues arise.',
      seoDescriptionAr: 'جهّز أنظمة SME السعودية لمراحل ZATCA — master data و device onboarding و invoice fields و testing قبل penalties production.',
      title: 'ZATCA E-Invoicing Preparation Checklist for SMEs',
      titleAr: 'قائمة الاستعداد للفوترة الإلكترونية وفق هيئة الزكاة والضريبة والجمارك',
      excerpt: 'E-invoicing readiness is data hygiene and test environments — not a last-minute API patch. Align POS, AR, and master data before phase deadlines.',
      excerptAr: 'e-invoicing readiness data hygiene test environments — not last-minute API patch. align POS AR master data phase deadlines.',
      featuredImageAlt: 'Saudi tax reporting and e-invoice configuration screen',
